    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/8757de4014707ebcc7d4de27bab9b7b8.poster.avif?t=1624458248\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/8757de4014707ebcc7d4de27bab9b7b8.webm?t=1624458248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>This saying cannot apply in your clinic, and the only person responsible for that is you!<br>Remember about careful sterilization of your tools, and make sure you used the right anaesthetics for the job. Remember, you never get a second chance to make a good first impression.<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/2fa73ce827199853c4855fd97483da2e.poster.avif?t=1624458248\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/2fa73ce827199853c4855fd97483da2e.webm?t=1624458248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Before you can afford a bigger clinic you\u2019ll have to work for it. The more satisfied customers, the faster you\u2019ll earn it. Purchase modern tools and expand the capabilities of your current workplace. Oh and don\u2019t get overwhelmed by the popularity of your services, reaching the top requires sacrifice!<br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/dc83d7c1f954f8934d171dec2062d476.poster.avif?t=1624458248\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460770/extras/dc83d7c1f954f8934d171dec2062d476.webm?t=1624458248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>It\u2019s time to start the procedure! Doesn\u2019t matter if it\u2019s just a simple checkup or a complicated surgery of root canal treatment, you gotta do your absolute best. The patient\u2019s comfort and more importantly, his health is on the line. Every slip of your hand or unprofessional approach will cost you your popularity, and without it, you won\u2019t go too far.<br><br><br><br>The tricks of the trade / In and outs of the profession.<br><br>All the treatments you\u2019ll be performing in the game are based on real simulations.<br>Thanks to the Boring Game, you\u2019ll not only get a chance to feel like a dentist but also understand and learn more about how a real dental clinic function and how to perform each and every procedure.<br><br><br>ATTENTION - 9 out of 10 dentists recommend this game (the rest of them are probably not real gamers)",
